{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":57,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["義人死亡，無人關心，",{"text":"虔誠人去世，無人明白。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實義人去世是脫離災難。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些正直的人得享平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在墓床上得到安息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們這些巫婆的兒子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"姦夫和妓女的後代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上前來吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們在嘲笑誰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向誰張嘴吐舌呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們難道不是悖逆的兒女、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"詭詐的後代嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們在橡樹間、綠樹下欲火焚燒，祭拜偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在山谷間和巖穴中殺兒女作祭物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們把谷中光滑的石頭當偶像敬奉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"效忠於它們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向它們澆奠獻祭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈能容忍？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們在高聳的山上鋪設床榻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們上到那裡獻祭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們在門和門框後面供奉神像。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們背棄我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"脫衣上床，掀開床鋪，與它們苟合，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們迷戀它們的床，愛看它們的淫態。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們帶著橄欖油和許多香料去獻給摩洛神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"差遣使者到遠方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至去陰間尋找神明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然遙遠的路途使你們疲倦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們卻沒有放棄。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們找到了新的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以沒有暈倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「你們懼怕誰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致對我說謊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不把我放在心上，忘記我？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不再敬畏我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是因為我長期沉默嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要揭露你們所謂的公義和作為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們對你們毫無益處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當你們呼求的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓你們收集的神像來救你們吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"風必把它們颳去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是一口氣也會把它們吹走。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但投靠我的必承受這片土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擁有我的聖山。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["主安慰痛悔者"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「要修路，修路，鋪平道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"清除我子民路上的障礙。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那至高至上、永遠長存的聖者說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我住在至高至聖之處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我也跟痛悔、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"謙卑的人同住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們心靈振作起來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不會永遠指責，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不會一直發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以免我所造的世人昏倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因他們貪婪之罪而發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我懲罰他們，憤怒地轉臉不理他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻一意孤行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看見了他們的所作所為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我還是要醫治他們，引領他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們和那些哀傷的人得安慰，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們開口讚美。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願平安臨到遠近各方的人！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要醫治他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，惡人就像波濤洶湧、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難以平靜的大海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海浪中湧出淤泥和汙物。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝說：「惡人必得不到平安。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/57.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/58.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/56.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}